r","Nick Spano","Amy Grabow","Ray Porter","Bob Joles","David Weisenberg","Joe Camareno","Lorin Shapiro","Lydia Jordan","Eddie Goines","Stephon Fuller","Marvin Bang","Andrew Elvis Miller","Joe Holt","Carl J. Johnson","Elena Evangelo","Abby Walker","Sara Sanderson","Janie Haddad Tompkins","Karen Strassman","Desmond Campbell","David Winston Barge","Constance Ejuma","Kevin Dunigan","Eli Harris","Michael Stoyanov","Daniel Browning Smith","Victor Dean","Benjamin Burdick","Joel Bryant","Rodney Saulsberry","Bill Chott","Christopher Boyer","Wanda Acuna","Andi Matheny","Terri Hoyos","Ryan Alvarez","Peter James Smith","Elle Downs","Olivia Sui","Marco Infante","Nick DeMauro","Rita Zohar","Sue Cremin","Patrick Thomas O'Brien","Albert Malafronte","David Hadinger","Americus Abesamis","Charles Dougherty","Cheyenne Wilbur","Dwayne Barnes","Tom Yi","Seth Isler","Judy Echavez","Jane Luk","Ivan Shaw","Justin Dray","Howard Hoover","James Mathis III","Christon Blue","Anthony Holiday","Lance Patrick","Connor Carmody","David Greenman","Marty Ryan","Jeff Holman","Parker Goris","Wayne Nickel","Ross Mackenzie","Jorge Luis Abreu","Brent King","Sven Holmberg","Amy Ryder","John Maynard","Damara Reilly","John Bellucci","John Sterling Carter","William Christian","Tim Halligan","Ralph Meyering Jr.","Dmitri S. Boudrine","Hayley Chase","Juliana Donald","Zoe Keller","Todd Kimsey","Josh Drennen","Hawk Younkins","Verda Bridges","Gregory Wagrowski","Chane't Johnson","Jackie Richardson","Matt Champagne","Larry Brown","Roy Lee Jones","Sam Vance","Darlene Kardon","Mark Totty","Daniel Passer","Christina Ferraro","Julia Sanford","Keisuke Hoashi","Mif","James Curreri","Kaine Bennett Charleston","Lennie Loftin","Skip O'Brien","Amanda MacDonald","Denver Dowridge","Ashley Rose","Devon Kelly","Lou George","Keith Ewell","Gina St. John","Shana Stein","Dougald Park","Hira Ambrosino","Bobby Block","Jeffrey Scott Kelly","Gary Kraus","Bruce Hunter","Eric Artell","Angelina Wahler","Tom Ohmer","Jazz Raycole","Jonathan Rannells","David Gore","David Castellani","Grant Garrison","Christine Holz-Lusita","George Ketsios","Jack Marino","Cutter Garcia","Jeff Bowser","Juan Chioran","Dave Nichols","Michael Bower","Sean Donnellan"],"screenwriters":["Tom Scharpling","Hy Conrad","Joe Toplyn","Andy Breckman","David Breckman","Daniel Dratch","Jack Bernstein","Jonathan Collier","Rob LaZebnik","Michael Angeli","Timothy J. Lea","Mitch Markowitz","Alan Zweibel","John Romano","James Krieg","David M. Stern","Nell Scovell","Liz Sagal","Karl Schaefer","William Rabkin","Lee Goldberg","Blair Singer","Tom Gammill","Ben Gruber","Max Pross","Siobhan Byrne O'Connor","Jon Wurster","Chris Manheim","Daniel Schofield"],"cinematographers":["Anthony R. Palmieri","Joe Pennella","Hugo Cortina","Jerzy Zieliński","Tom Priestley Jr.","Jim Westenbrink","Marshall Adams"],"composers":["Jeff Beal","Patrick Williams"],"reviews":[{"author":"monolog","text":"V době, kdy je dobrých a pokud možno (v mezích možností) inteligentních humorných detektivních a krimi seriálů v televizi jako šafránu na bouřlivých výšinách, je tohle příjemný obláček chladivého stínu na poledním nebi. Není to sice žádná akčňárna ani tam nikdo nestřílí o 106, ale je to sranda a o hlavním hrdinovi se dá říct, že v těch případech opravdu něco zkoumá a logicky odvozuje, a ne jen hledá dia ex machina jako téměř všude jinde. A pozor, mluvím teď o americké tv tvorbě, ne britské případně někde jinde. Hádám, že nejvíc se mi líbil asi díl, jak byl světu představen bratr pana Monka, a i zbytek jeho rodiny. Ten by si nikdo neměl nechat ujít, aby viděl, jak nakonec všichni kvůli práci dopadneme.(16.01.2006)","stars":4},{"author":"C0r0ner","text":"Je to vtipné, je to neobvyklé, je to skvěle zahrané (casting dopadl na jedničku), příběhy jsou zajímavé..., ale časem se to omrzí. Kdyby měl Monk dohromady nějakých padesát případů, tak bych o plném hodnocení nepochyboval, ale s takovou náloží dílů už scenáristé (logicky) upadli do stereotypu, který postupně začal nudit. 80%(21.02.2017)","stars":4},{"author":"Trainspotter","text":"Přehnaně čistotný detektiv s kokofobií paradoxně jako jediný vyčnívá ze smrduté žumpy nedělního odpoledního vysílaní nejmenované stanice (AKA TV Sračka). Humor je příjemný, Monk místy i odzbrojující (ale stejně byste rádi žádného takového troubu potkat nechtěli) a pointy detektivních zápletek mnohdy i originální. Na druhou stranu je to jenom seriál, který vyplňuje mezery mezo reklamními bloky. Na závěr malé moudro: Mezi slepými jednooký králem.(04.02.2008)","stars":3}],"vods":[{"platform":"Prime Video","url":"https://www.primevideo.com/detail/amzn1.dv.gti.48b3d6f2-3427-f19f-41c9-39f76ecc15fb"},{"platform":"SledovaniTV","url":"https://sledovanitv.cz/epg/event/telka:20260503237188312bb10b597bb5c43d6e4788ff"}],"link":"https://www.csfd.cz/film/71284-muj-pritel-monk/prehled/","csfd_id":71284,"root_id":71284,"root_title_id":null,"root_title":null,"root_slug":null,"is_toplevel":true,"season_no":null,"episode_no":null,"season_count":8,"episode_count":124,"is_running":false,"cadence_days":null,"first_vod_date":null,"last_vod_date":null,"episodes":[]}